  "details": "Currently, the camera and the avatar menu cannot be opened at the same time.\n\nFor example when testing stuff on desktop, it would be much more effective and pleasant to be able to able to have your camera open and the be able to open the avatar menu (pushing the R key by default) and operate it.\n\nThis way solo-testing in desktop would be much more effective, because you do not always see everything in a mirror + you do not always want to go to an avatar testing world to look at what your avatar looks like from various angles while testing.",
